{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q2313471","formula":"C₁₉H₁₇Cl₂N₃O₅S","hill":"C19H17Cl2N3O5S","elements":["H","C","N","O","S","Cl"],"composition":{"C":19.0,"H":17.0,"N":3.0,"O":5.0,"S":1.0,"Cl":2.0},"names":{"en":"Dicloxacillin","uk":"Диклоксацилін"},"descriptions":{"en":"Dicloxacillin is a narrow-spectrum β-lactam antibiotic of the penicillin class. It is used to treat infections caused by susceptible (non-resistant) Gram-positive bacteria. It is active against beta-lactamase-producing organisms such as Staphylococcus aureus, which would otherwise be resistant to most penicillins.","uk":"Диклоксацилін — бета-лактамний антибіотик вузького спектру дії з групи пеніцилінів. Він використовується для лікування інфекцій, спричинених чутливими грам-позитивними бактеріями. Препарат активний проти організмів, що продукують бета-лактамази, зокрема проти Staphylococcus aureus, які в іншому випадку були б стійкими до більшості пеніцилінів."},"fame":28,"pubchemCid":18381,"mass":470.3,"charge":0,"smiles":"CC1=C(C(=NO1)C2=C(C=CC=C2Cl)Cl)C(=O)N[C@H]3[C@@H]4N(C3=O)[C@H](C(S4)(C)C)C(=O)O","inchikey":"YFAGHNZHGGCZAX-JKIFEVAISA-N","iupac":"(2S,5R,6R)-6-[[3-(2,6-dichlorophenyl)-5-methyl-1,2-oxazole-4-carbonyl]amino]-3,3-dimethyl-7-oxo-4-thia-1-azabicyclo[3.2.0]heptane-2-carboxylic acid","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"18381","atoms":47,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":1.754,"y":-1.43,"z":-2.686,"el":"Cl"},{"x":2.444,"y":-1.262,"z":2.75,"el":"Cl"},{"x":-1.323,"y":0.879,"z":-1.597,"el":"S"},{"x":-1.757,"y":0.324,"z":2.752,"el":"O"},{"x":-5.373,"y":-1.033,"z":-0.033,"el":"O"},{"x":-5.178,"y":0.915,"z":1.135,"el":"O"},{"x":1.497,"y":2.864,"z":-0.534,"el":"O"},{"x":4.98,"y":0.491,"z":-0.391,"el":"O"},{"x":-2.571,"y":1.077,"z":0.668,"el":"N"},{"x":0.604,"y":1.188,"z":0.773,"el":"N